{"id": "DeChOhIPszm", "title": "Video by nick_saraev", "description": "Comment \"AGENT\" to get these AI skills to run your LinkedIn with Claude Code.\n\nClaude can now run your entire LinkedIn for completely free.\n\nSomeone on GitHub just dropped 12 LinkedIn skills.\n\nThey plug straight into your Claude Code.\n\nOne writes your posts.\n\nAnother handles your comments.\n\nAnd another one optimizes your whole profile so more people find you.\n\nFirst, it starts by interviewing you about your job and career.\n\nSo everything it writes is built on your own real stories.\n\nIn your own exact tone and voice.\n\nThen it plans out your whole week of content.\n\nFrom the topics to the hooks to the best time to post.\n\nBased on 20 proven formulas.\n\nPlus before anything goes out, it checks your post against LinkedIn's latest algorithm rules.\n\nAnd it removes anything that sounds AI written.\n\nSo your posts don't get flagged.\n\nThink of it like hiring a full time LinkedIn ghostwriter who already knows your whole story.\n\nNo more staring at a blank post box wondering what to write.\n\nNo more guessing which topics or posting times will actually work.\n\nThe whole week gets planned before you open the app.\n\nIt works for posts, comments, and your profile all in one single place.\n\n#claudecode #linkedin #aiskills #claudeai #linkedinAi", "channel": "nick_saraev", "uploader_id": "72269881052", "uploader": "Nick Saraev", "timestamp": 1791046034, "like_count": 3129, "comment_count": 7430, "http_headers": {"Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-1061686043363808a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 65.612, "asr": 48000, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.famd5-3.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQOoTKm-WNHPr_Zr73xeU3TQlhA42XFCBnvkAgIZ7czgA-fPe2E1V1oTenLC-FRl2lzHEy6a45c4DZhjNGdvaVe3A2KsrICn6bGmlVA.mp4?_nc_cat=105&_nc_oc=Ado4H1-WBL5OK1l2yn9DqXOO2cnJGsqmVG79jqfMnyMyPvluHXeaKF